## 3. Verdict Rules

- VERIFIED requires: method stated, evidence hash recomputed matching, no open contradiction rows.
- UNVERIFIED: default state for any claim lacking a complete row.
- CONTRADICTED: blocks the claim from citation in current/ until resolved (phase38-57 §5).
